msgstr "⟪k:0⟫你来到洋馆那一刻——我就知道这是命中注定的。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_81463A50_FEBD_4A7A_9C7A_E2EC0C6BCF0C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2623ee3c9ba7b147ca1d3da01846d7ce948d4a919181612491c80149ea0bc827
