msgstr "⟪k:0⟫至今为止，你经历了许多痛苦吧……"

#: scenario7:scenario7_D858E240_F039_447C_B1C0_07C43C90FB4C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
