#: scenario7:scenario7_ED94CB92_5964_46E6_9B5A_7065208EF56B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ca798593e3c84a77f31c7d8fae0895a351854b2d19b43ec5c3442e95de4839d1
