msgstr "⟪k:0⟫就算他们的肉身已经腐朽……"

#: scenario7:scenario7_D4E5927C_C209_48BF_A235_21727A0C5234
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d782efa045be9726f863d298b3e3d2f0130e467298e90e60e3dc8a6c4e6b4db3
