msgstr "⟪k:0⟫只要他们的灵魂还存在，⟪k:1⟫他们的痛苦便永无止境……"

#: scenario7:scenario7_D449F5C1_B1B1_4276_B37A_ADD7D10D46BE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eaa15c63a6e1fd4b89f853e6927819fb32c055dac2a53bf3b29f26d29165878c
