msgstr "⟪k:0⟫你是什么人……"

#: scenario7:scenario7_E2088DD3_5F4E_4D55_B5A4_21971D01EB82
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: df5a87398cd6b1c8f9d3afac47ff603effe74ae1158606e9b9d32ff4360e2ffa
