"⟪k:0⟫That I am.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I am the cursed witch, who loathes this puny, wretched world—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"⟪k:5⟫curses it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫是的……⟪k:1⟫我就是被诅咒的魔女……⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫憎恨并诅咒这渺小世界的魔女……"

#: scenario7:scenario7_B635749A_FC83_4FFC_A662_B0FD9832BB0B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5d6b902a1a84730f06fed616c3e8e83064f2a451f0b87587aacc65a437fec88f
