msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫我名为莫尔加娜。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_771B2BBE_68D4_4842_B6F4_FAF4FD301BC8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ec1088fd963832c6acc2c7818b691ce0019d4b92653dd642b7560f4e4f23e959
