#: scenario7:scenario7_745E07C6_2877_4A93_BE88_6009A8257722
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3d78784a1c35baa8e37c2860212c10d106114ac3839995451c6c77f5bdd49361
