"⟪k:0⟫I could place a curse on someone you have a grudge against.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Drag them down into the "
"dark abyss."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫就来诅咒你憎恨的人吧。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫令其坠入不见天日的黑暗之中。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_5591326A_723D_440F_BD0C_467CDB8381D6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1e9c3b135f9dc65d12b02f20c784046d97046249800a30f22736e68e48588a23
