msgstr "⟪k:0⟫所以，⟪k:1⟫我会实现你的愿望……"

#: scenario7:scenario7_4965D32C_A833_4DA2_A2B2_72ED7724F309
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
